      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Focused on the lost key, The kitchen staff feigns ignorance about the lost key until Chef produces a spare. Let's listen closely to Chef Viktor and the staff's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Никто не видел запасного ключа?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "А мы не знаем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "И не видели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Но вообще...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Ничем не смогу вам помочь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мои сотрудники потеряли ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Экая досада.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ой, ой, ой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "А как же нам быть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "У меня есть запасной ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я всегда дубликаты храню.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А, вот он, ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Нашелся ключ?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Никто не видел запасного ключа?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has anyone seen the spare key?' Barinov pretends to look for a missing item, stalling for time while standing in front of the locked door.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "А мы не знаем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We do not know.' Senya plays along with the boss's act, denying any knowledge of the missing object.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "И не видели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And we have not seen it.' Adding to the lie, the cook insists that they have not laid eyes on the item in question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Но вообще...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But, generally speaking...' The frustrated official tries to interject, clearly losing patience with the obvious delay tactics.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Ничем не смогу вам помочь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am afraid I cannot help you.' Delivering a dismissive remark, the official states his inability to assist in the current situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мои сотрудники потеряли ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My staff lost the key.' Trying to stall the raid, Barinov claims with a straight face that his staff misplaced the storage room key.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Экая досада.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a shame.' Barinov reacts with exaggerated, theatrical disappointment to the news about the missing item.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ой, ой, ой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, oh, oh.' The chef continues his fake performance of distress with a series of theatrical sighs.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "А как же нам быть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So what are we to do?' Asking a rhetorical question, the guest pushes them to find a solution to this convenient problem.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "У меня есть запасной ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a spare key.' Barinov suddenly produces a solution, ending the charade of the lost item.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я всегда дубликаты храню.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I always keep a duplicate.' The boss brags about his foresight, explaining why he conveniently had a backup ready.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А, вот он, ключ.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ah, there is the key.' Once the coast is clear, Barinov pats his pocket and pretends to discover the missing key at last.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Нашелся ключ?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Found the key?' The officer responds with heavy sarcasm, clearly not believing the little performance he just watched. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
